| Step Type         | Purpose             | What It Fixes         |
| ----------------- | ------------------- | --------------------- |
| dropna()          | Remove rows         | Completely empty rows |
| drop_duplicates() | Remove duplicates   | Repeated records      |
| to_numeric()      | Fix datatype        | Wrong numeric values  |
| to_datetime()     | Fix date format     | Invalid dates         |
| fillna()          | Fill missing values | Null values           |


